{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちはるーむへようこそ〜！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/09/13/9665073/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これはいつの集合写真でしょうか\\( ˆoˆ )/？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"①みんなで夜ご飯を食べに行った時の写真"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"②アンダーMVを撮り終わった夜の写真"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"③グアムで夜ご飯を食べる前の写真"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなの服装や\nメンバーの雰囲気を見て当ててみて〜♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"-------------------------♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日写真どうしようかな〜と\n思ってフォルダを漁っていて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全国ツアーのときの写真を見ていたら\nびっくりするくらい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"食べ物の写真ばかりだった！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから載せようかと思ったけど\n皆さんへの飯テロと\n自分自身への飯テロになりそうなので\nやめます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふふ(﹡ˆ ˆ﹡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"代わりに生写真撮影のときの写真を。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"シークレットグラフィティー♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/09/13/9665073/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここ最近で一番好きな衣装！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"青パターンと赤パターンがあって、\n私は青なんだけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スカートとヘアバンド、イヤリングが\n青になっててとっても可愛い(﹡ˆ ˆ﹡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてなんと言っても付け襟！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"付け襟大好き〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一気に衣装が締まる！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これは結構前に撮影した\n黒レースのワンピース衣装♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/09/13/9665073/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こういうレースの透け感が好きなので\n私服にも欲しいくらい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもなかなかワンピースって\n私服じゃ着ないから\n撮影ならでは。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年のバレンタイン衣装♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2016/09/13/9665073/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バレンタインの衣装は\nピンクでフリフリ！っていう\nイメージも強かったんだけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年のは茶色くて例年よりかは少しシックな\nチョコレート風で可愛かった(﹡ˆ ˆ﹡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私、生写真あるあるなんだけど\nどんな衣装を着ても"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本物っ